acceptance_criteria: "package manage and its diagnostics accept the universal read controls advertised by the runtime contract, or reject unsupported controls before execution with a precise recovery receipt; CLI and SDK contract parity tests cover token budgets, context sessions, fields, cursors, and output formats; a temporary-project acceptance test proves the installed extension path"
